QghwdPytgB_AVCKme37k47JNIhmw&oe=6AE4AB97"}, {"file_name": "OculusScreenshot1702168621.png", "id": "1417106885903761", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75222941_1417106889237094_8505880443188676782_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SeLPp6hWOYwQ7kNvwF4SRqn&_nc_oc=AdogmULgAl5Qeei9uxhX0tmrqCCa0dS3nVO3XDLLoCYQhdJryuRHPa0DZBMikCXcCUQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMKjVbVFizdvGRHLf_j_6P1CmVuBID_jcA1xIgddWuSFg&oe=6AE491D7"}, {"file_name": "OculusScreenshot1702169640.png", "id": "1024146142213818", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982441_1024146145547151_3805722331130364725_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=01uaElpYe28Q7kNvwE2cyH8&_nc_oc=AdrgSrfFW9RLXvFiIE2NfetI_TJzxBkY7xVDogMQ6mer_h7eiHFtOsCGF7iUw4LzOBI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNwujtZkn7sjfyiNbjNZVw6OVBrEbQGtz_7LSXFNO7-fg&oe=6AE4BD97"}, {"file_name": "OculusScreenshot1702168716.png", "id": "1045546456768821", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031557_1045546460102154_8869584294705848419_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WdiU0ptPbWIQ7kNvwHTj4y-&_nc_oc=AdqIyD0cXrO3JI1-fGo3KZ4A9wMwfKIPQsEIpI1lFgWlkWPjijHYFta79kleI7nh4o0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMjQ2-g-Ugg65Sb-qaiDKYVlOO-BZV2OqnXyI-VRPHcGw&oe=6AE4AB54"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "OculusScreenshot1702169579.png", "id": "1421996451722456", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974657_1421996455055789_5575213174514540843_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sy09df2K_hkQ7kNvwHEc4SA&_nc_oc=AdrREpPFjGNX8dFTKC7hfRu5SQoqgrqrmzR9IiMVdqB8rKdDuCpaWP2r7dWoUUkv4bk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOXtou7nj8AUv5coBpD9-k7fY-E6F6pK49rT8dWG7HmKA&oe=6AE4A29C"}, "display_name": "StarGateVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**StarGateVR** puts astronomical data in your hands \u2014 query archives, visualize in 3D, and collaborate in VR on Meta Quest.\n\n**Live archive access:**\n\u2022 Query Gaia DR3 directly \u2014 describe a dataset and retrieve it live\n\u2022 Cross-match with multi-wavelength archives in a single command\n\u2022 Integrated: Gaia DR3 \u00b7 eROSITA \u00b7 GALEX \u00b7 2MASS \u00b7 WISE \u00b7 SIMBAD \u00b7 MOCA\n\n**3D visualization:**\n\u2022 Map any parameters to spatial axes\n\u2022 Switch between physical coordinates, HR diagrams, and custom parameter spaces\n\u2022 Color and shade points by additional variables\n\n**Multi-dimensional gating:**\n\u2022 Select and filter data interactively in 3D space\n\u2022 Isolate populations across parameter dimensions\n\n**Collaboration:**\n\u2022 Shared VR sessions with voice communication\n\u2022 Enriched datasets sync across all participants\n\n**Your data, your way:**\n\u2022 Import CSV, VOTable, or FITS formats\n\u2022 Export findings for follow-up in TOPCAT, astropy, or your own pipelines\n\n**AI Assistant (Early Access):**\n\u2022 Voice-controlled \u2014 query datasets and archives by speaking naturally\n\u2022 Requires internet and Meta sign-in. Improves automatically, no update required.\n\u2022 In development. Feedback welcome: support@immsci.com\n\nDesigned for researchers, educators, and advanced hobbyists.\n\nLooking for an educational introduction to 3D star mapping? Try **ConstellationsVR**, our entry-level experience with an AI astronomy guide for STEM learners.\n\nNote: StarGateVR is a scientific research tool by Immersive Science LLC. It is not affiliated with the Stargate media franchise or the Stargate AI initiative.", "short_description": "Explore, analyze, and collaborate on multi-dimensional astronomical data in VR \u2014 query Gaia, SIMBAD, and multi-wavelength archives directly from your headset."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.immsci.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_